<title>USA: FedEx starts flat-rate boxes to Carib/Latam.</title>
<headline>FedEx starts flat-rate boxes to Carib/Latam.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Express Corp said it has launched its FedEx 25kg Box and FedEx 10kg flat-rate products in nine Latin American and 30 Caribbean countries.</p>
<p>FedEx Boxes are customs cleared, door to door and time certain services with delivery commitments from one to three days and can be shipped to 211 countries, the company said.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
